<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Plessey cautions it still in talks.</title>
<headline>Plessey cautions it still in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plessey Corporation Ltd said on Friday, referring to an earlier cautionery,  it was still in talks which could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
